---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="contact" class="footer">
  <div class="container footer-container">
    <div class="footer-cta">
      <h2 class="footer-title">¿Listo para empezar un proyecto?</h2>
      <p>Hablemos de tus ideas y cómo puedo ayudarte a hacerlas realidad.</p>
      <a href="mailto:contacto@ejemplo.com" class="btn btn-primary">Envíame un mensaje</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>&copy; {currentYear} Portafolio Profesional. Creado con Astro.</p>
      
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="#" aria-label="GitHub">GitHub</a>
        <a href="#" aria-label="LinkedIn">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="#" aria-label="Twitter">Twitter</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    background-color: hsl(var(--color-bg-surface));
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .footer-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .footer-cta {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .footer-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, #aaa);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .footer-cta p {
    color: hsl(var(--color-text-muted));
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background-color: hsl(var(--color-accent-primary));
    color: white;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  
  .btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 5px 20px hsl(var(--color-accent-primary) / 0.4);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: hsl(var(--color-text-muted));
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .social-links a:hover {
    color: hsl(var(--color-text-main));
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
